  "version": 2,
  "decision": "D-49",
  "adr": "docs/cloud/126-adr-native-owner-panel.md",
  "criterion": "docs/cloud/43-native-independence.json",
  "checker": "tools/installables-125.mjs",
  "test": "tests/installables-125.js",
  "rules": [
    "Every Android project, Windows installer, desktop shell, launcher, web-wrapper config, install script and tracked installable binary MUST be listed by exact path in some entry's entrypoints (directory prefixes do not count), and every workflow-built asset in some entry's artifacts (unregistered => CI red).",
    "declared=native is allowed only when the sources contain no WebView / browser-engine / web-UI / Node-for-UI usage AND every built artifact is run through tools/native-independence-gate.mjs (without --expect-fail) in CI.",
    "A WebView build may never be declared native and may never be published (row 129 removed the last ones). It may exist only as a CI-only negative control or a frozen fixture, with published=[].",
    "The gate criterion (docs/cloud/43-native-independence.json) may only grow: the frozen baseline in tools/installables-125.mjs must stay a subset of it.",
    "Release channels listed in native_only_channels may carry only declared=native entries.",
    "Release channels and the download page carry only files that passed tools/native-independence-gate.mjs on the same file; native-continuous (school-native-publish.yml) is written only by that publisher (row 129)."
  ],
